1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,670
(Stuart:)staying at your mom's
through all this.

2
00:00:01,668 --> 00:00:03,668
I-I couldn't have done it
otherwise.

3
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:06,740
(Howard:)I appreciate that,
and I'm glad you were able to...

4
00:00:08,542 --> 00:00:09,942
(Howard:)Is that my mother's furniture?

5
00:00:13,213 --> 00:00:14,513
(Stuart:)Yeah, she said
I could use it.

6
00:00:14,514 --> 00:00:15,884
(Stuart:)Doesn't it look
great?

7
00:00:15,882 --> 00:00:19,022
(Howard:)Not as great as it looks in
the den where it belongs.

8
00:00:19,019 --> 00:00:20,719
(Bernadette:)Howie.

9
00:00:20,721 --> 00:00:23,891
(Howard:)Why don't you just clean out
the whole room?

10
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:26,220
(Howard:)Take the string art clown
I made her in third grade

11
00:00:26,226 --> 00:00:27,826
(Howard:)and the ribbon I got
in swim class

12
00:00:27,828 --> 00:00:29,258
(Howard:)for putting my face
in the water.

13
00:00:29,262 --> 00:00:30,592
(Stuart:)What is your problem?

14
00:00:30,597 --> 00:00:31,927
(Stuart:)She said it was okay.

15
00:00:31,932 --> 00:00:34,532
(Howard:)Well, I'm her son,
and I say it's not okay.

16
00:00:34,534 --> 00:00:37,974
(Stuart:)Some son-- looks like you spent
ten minutes on that clown art.

17
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,310
(Howard:)Well, maybe I should've gone
to a fancy art school like you.

18
00:00:42,309 --> 00:00:43,939
(Howard:)Then I could run
a failed comic shop

19
00:00:43,944 --> 00:00:45,314
(Howard:)and mooch off
some guy's mother.

20
00:00:46,613 --> 00:00:48,183
(Bernadette:)Why don't we leave
so you can cool off?

21
00:00:48,181 --> 00:00:50,181
(Stuart:)I think that's
a good idea.

22
00:00:50,183 --> 00:00:51,453
(Stuart:)Take him out
of my store.

23
00:00:51,451 --> 00:00:52,551
Your store?!

24
00:00:52,552 --> 00:00:54,552
(Howard:)My mother gave you
the money to reopen.

25
00:00:54,554 --> 00:00:56,154
(Howard:)I'm not going anywhere.

26
00:00:56,156 --> 00:00:57,856
(Leonard:)Why don't we go get
the food for the party.

27
00:00:57,858 --> 00:00:58,958
(Barry:)Thank you.

28
00:00:58,959 --> 00:01:00,959
(Raj:)Smart-- looks like
we're being helpful.

